# UI Rebuild Methodology (Final AI Reset)

> **Phase D:** suspended — [`docs/PRODUCT/DEMOLITION_PLAN.md`](../../docs/PRODUCT/DEMOLITION_PLAN.md) only (`00-phase-d-demolition.mdc`)  
> **Phase R intent (not execution queue):** [`UX_REFERENCE_CANON.md`](../../docs/SSOT/UX_REFERENCE_CANON.md) · `docs/SSOT/*_UX_CANON.md`  
> **Deprecated for execution:** v2 wave docs (Batch 11 deleted) · mockup pixel queue · `docs/rebuild/*` UI plan — **참고·이력만**

## Pipeline (Phase R intent · not current paths)

```text
UX reference (의도 참조 — clone 아님)
  → Phase R token SOT 정의
  → Phase R component ownership 정의
  → 페이지 조립 + 3-breakpoint 반응형
  → 검증 (multi-viewport · a11y · dead control 0 · money Σ=0 · gate:ai-impl)
```

**Do not** implement surfaces by pixel-matching external PNG at a single width. **Do not** treat external mockup `pixelmatch` diff% as surface DONE.

## Reference role

| Allowed | Forbidden |
|---------|-----------|
| Extract layout · hierarchy · density · trust cues from reference products ([`UX_REFERENCE_CANON.md`](../../docs/SSOT/UX_REFERENCE_CANON.md)) | Clone competitor copy · logo · asset · unique visual identity |
| Surface-specific canon + [`SURFACE_BLUEPRINTS.md`](../../docs/SSOT/SURFACE_BLUEPRINTS.md) modules | Inline arbitrary hex without token (`rgb(31 224 138)` in JSX) |
| Token-first responsive typography | Hardcoded px typography as the only responsive strategy |

## Component ownership

- Pre-demolition paths such as `@phonara/ui`, `apps/web/src/theme.css`,
  `apps/web/src/ui/design/*`, and `apps/web/src/components/ui/*` were deleted in v5 Demolition.
- They are not active implementation targets.
- Phase R must define component ownership in a new plan/ADR before any UI code is created.

## Responsive shell

- **3 tiers:** mobile 390 · tablet 768 (`md:`) · desktop 1024 (`lg:`) — **not** single mockup width.
- **Code SOT:** Phase R TBD. Pre-demolition shell names such as `AppShell`,
  `.shell-content-column`, `design-system.css`, and `viewport-contract.ts` are intent/history only.
- **Pages:** use `md:`/`lg:` + `--ds-*` tokens; no prod `max-w-[390px]` bypassing shell column

## Gates

**Primary (surface closeout):**

- `gate:ai-impl -- --test <path>` · `typecheck` · `check:i18n` · `check:release`
- Multi-viewport smoke · axe critical 0 · dead control 0
- Relevant money E2E Σ=0 when surface touches money paths

**Demoted (legacy — not primary for new surfaces):**

- External PNG `pixelmatch` · mockup fixture-form harness · pixel baseline diff% as DONE gate

Heavy visual/E2E: operator 「gate 실행」 or CI only (`80` G13). Entrypoint: [`docs/SSOT/OPERATOR_GATES.md`](../../docs/SSOT/OPERATOR_GATES.md).

